#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:4
msgid "DHCP Relays"
msgstr "Retransmissões DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:6
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Network Server) > "
"DHCP``"
msgstr "``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Network Server) > DHCP``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:11
msgid ""
"DHCP Relays forward DHCP requests from clients on one network segment to "
"a DHCP server on another segment. This eliminates the need for a DHCP "
"server on every subnet while still allowing clients to receive dynamic IP"
" address assignments. |morpheus| supports creating, editing, and deleting"
" DHCP relays within supported network server integrations such as VMware "
"NSX-T."
msgstr "Retransmissões DHCP encaminham solicitações DHCP de clientes em um segmento de rede para um servidor DHCP em outro segmento. Isso elimina a necessidade de um servidor DHCP em cada sub-rede, permitindo ainda que os clientes recebam atribuições dinâmicas de endereço IP. O |morpheus| oferece suporte à criação, edição e exclusão de retransmissões DHCP em integrações de servidor de rede suportadas, como VMware NSX-T."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:13
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:35
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:13
msgid ""
"DHCP relay management is available on network server integrations that "
"support this capability (``hasDhcpRelays`` flag)."
msgstr "O gerenciamento de retransmissão DHCP está disponível em integrações de servidor de rede que suportam essa capacidade (flag ``hasDhcpRelays``)."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:16
msgid "Viewing DHCP Relays"
msgstr "Visualizando Retransmissões DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:18
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:26
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:42
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:52
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"
msgstr "Navegue até ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:19
msgid "Select the desired network server integration (e.g., NSX-T)"
msgstr "Selecione a integração de servidor de rede desejada (ex.: NSX-T)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:20
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:28
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:44
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:54
msgid "Click the **DHCP** tab"
msgstr "Clique na aba **DHCP**"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:21
msgid ""
"DHCP Relays are displayed in the lower section of the tab, below DHCP "
"Servers"
msgstr "As Retransmissões DHCP são exibidas na seção inferior da aba, abaixo dos Servidores DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:24
msgid "Adding a DHCP Relay"
msgstr "Adicionando uma Retransmissão DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:27
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:43
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:53
msgid "Select the desired network server integration"
msgstr "Selecione a integração de servidor de rede desejada"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:29
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD` in the DHCP Relays section"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`+ ADD` na seção DHCP Relays"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:30
msgid "Complete the required fields (fields vary by integration type):"
msgstr "Preencha os campos obrigatórios (os campos variam conforme o tipo de integração):"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nome"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:32
msgid "A name for the DHCP relay in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Um nome para a retransmissão DHCP no |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst
msgid "Server Addresses"
msgstr "Endereços do Servidor"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:33
msgid "The IP addresses of the DHCP server(s) to relay requests to"
msgstr "Os endereços IP do(s) servidor(es) DHCP para os quais retransmitir as solicitações"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:35
msgid ""
"Additional fields may appear based on the network integration type and "
"its configured option types."
msgstr "Campos adicionais podem aparecer com base no tipo de integração de rede e em seus option types configurados."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:37
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:47
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:40
msgid "Editing a DHCP Relay"
msgstr "Editando uma Retransmissão DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:45
msgid "Click the pencil (edit) icon for the target DHCP relay"
msgstr "Clique no ícone de lápis (editar) da retransmissão DHCP de destino"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:46
msgid "Modify the desired fields"
msgstr "Modifique os campos desejados"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:50
msgid "Deleting a DHCP Relay"
msgstr "Excluindo uma Retransmissão DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:55
msgid "Click the trash (delete) icon for the target DHCP relay"
msgstr "Clique no ícone de lixeira (excluir) da retransmissão DHCP de destino"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:56
msgid "Confirm the deletion when prompted"
msgstr "Confirme a exclusão quando solicitado"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:58
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Aviso"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:58
msgid ""
"Deleting a DHCP relay will remove the relay from both |morpheus| and the "
"upstream integration. Clients on segments served by this relay will lose "
"the ability to obtain DHCP leases."
msgstr "Excluir uma retransmissão DHCP a removerá tanto do |morpheus| quanto da integração upstream. Clientes em segmentos atendidos por esta retransmissão perderão a capacidade de obter leases DHCP."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:61
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:63
msgid ""
"DHCP relays are managed through the |morpheus| API at the following "
"endpoints:"
msgstr "As retransmissões DHCP são gerenciadas por meio da API do |morpheus| nos seguintes endpoints:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:65
msgid "``GET /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-relays`` — List DHCP relays"
msgstr "``GET /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-relays`` — Listar retransmissões DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:66
msgid ""
"``GET /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-relays/:id`` — Get a specific "
"DHCP relay"
msgstr "``GET /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-relays/:id`` — Obter uma retransmissão DHCP específica"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:67
msgid "``POST /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-relays`` — Create a DHCP relay"
msgstr "``POST /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-relays`` — Criar uma retransmissão DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:68
msgid ""
"``PUT /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-relays/:id`` — Update a DHCP "
"relay"
msgstr "``PUT /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-relays/:id`` — Atualizar uma retransmissão DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:69
msgid ""
"``DELETE /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-relays/:id`` — Delete a "
"DHCP relay"
msgstr "``DELETE /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-relays/:id`` — Excluir uma retransmissão DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:72
msgid "Required Role Permissions"
msgstr "Permissões de Função Obrigatórias"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_relays.rst:74
msgid ""
"Access to DHCP relay management requires the ``Infrastructure: Network "
"DHCP Relay`` permission (``infrastructure-network-dhcp-relay``) with "
"``read`` or ``full`` access."
msgstr "O acesso ao gerenciamento de retransmissão DHCP requer a permissão ``Infrastructure: Network DHCP Relay`` (``infrastructure-network-dhcp-relay``) com acesso ``read`` ou ``full``."

